+## 0. What this document is and is not
+
+- It is an **independently checkable evidence packet**: exact commits, stable paths,
+  evidence-at timestamps, verbatim condition text, condition interpretations, named
+  ambiguities, and the verification steps this seat actually performed.
+- It **does not** resolve, score, retract, edit, re-hash or re-order any ledger entry,
+  ballot, bill or law. No `resolve` command was run. No `true`/`false`/`unresolved`
+  outcome is asserted for any forecast. No future-due forecast is labelled early.
+- Every cited evidence timestamp is **after** the registration timestamp of the entry it
+  bears on (registration epochs: `1794126066` = 2026-11-08T08:21:06Z for the un-suffixed
+  bill; `1794134069` = 2026-11-08T10:34:29Z for v2; `1794137228` = 2026-11-08T11:27:08Z
+  for v3). This satisfies the Act 22 §3/§6 "evidence follows registration" requirement.
+- Resolution is reserved for the **next authorized sitting at or after
+  2026-11-22T00:00:00Z**, using `government/predict-ledger.py resolve` with a legitimate
+  POST-registration `--evidence-at`, per-entry content-hash verification and the ordinary
+  Act 21/31 integration path (§5 below).
